.el .ds Aq '
.TH mnnn-review-request 1  "mnnn-review-request 2.13.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-review\-request \- Ask for a review of an entry, journal, project, search or record (makes a link)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn review request\fR [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-title\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-note\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-label\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-peer\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-link\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIKIND\fR> <\fITARGET\fR> 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Ask for a review of an entry, journal, project, search or record (makes a link)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-title\fR \fI<TITLE>\fR [default: ]

.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-note\fR \fI<NOTE>\fR [default: ]
A word for reviewers
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\fR \fI<ALLOW>\fR
What reviewers may do: view, comment, suggest, highlight, vote (default: all)
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-label\fR \fI<LABEL>\fR [default: ]
Who the first link is for
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-peer\fR \fI<PEER>\fR
Send the link to this peer (a known peer, peer id or address)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-link\fR
Make no link yet (`mnnn review invite` makes them)
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIKIND\fR>
entry, journal, project, search or record
.TP
<\fITARGET\fR>
Its name or id (records: MODEL/RECORD)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.13.0
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
